name issue_737_outage_15s_100ms_seed2
describe issue_737_outage_15s_100ms with seed 2: ours in the ~1 s video-delay mode after link-up (e2e p95 951 ms), libwebrtc in the fast one (205 ms, loss 22 %) (#738)
